        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The chart below gives information about the growth of the urban population in certain parts of the world, including the prediction of the future. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SRX5d0SW8ozjHKxEs7RlA4yHgkb\"><em><strong>The chart below gives information about the growth of the urban population in certain parts of the world, including the prediction of the future. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Urban Population Growth: 1950, 2000 &amp; 2030</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CLFOdaXQXo81HuxXYt4lD4hSgmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BcAqdmlrvo9YfQxQ8txlkhjdgtd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Urban Population Growth: 1950, 2000 &amp; 2030 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số đ&ocirc; thị ở bốn khu vực tr&ecirc;n thế giới v&agrave;o ba năm: 1950, 2000 v&agrave; 2030.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O3LtdQTfLo1VDvxozLglWV05gXe\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRiCdhn6DoEFZYxcYWalJ3Kbgvb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Urban Population Growth: 1950, 2000 &amp; 2030 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ d&acirc;n th&agrave;nh thị - &nbsp;bốn khu vực tr&ecirc;n thế giới - ba năm: 1950, 2000 v&agrave; 2030.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VUCbdIJLNoa83HxibjUl3jeugxc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FMfZdZ3hhoHVmbxF3jDlUvmdgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Tất cả bốn khu vực đều c&oacute; xu hướng tăng về tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số đ&ocirc; thị trong suốt giai đoạn 80 năm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AxdQdjWOootDHvxmAShlH0fdg7f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Latin America lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; tỷ lệ d&acirc;n th&agrave;nh thị cao nhất, trong khi Africa v&agrave; Asia c&oacute; số liệu thấp hơn đ&aacute;ng kể.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Oo2UdJWyfogutexlC8Dlib9Vgae\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Latin America v&agrave; Whole World</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LIordh8JDosEIYx1KpdlG6Bhgwe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GQP3dbhx6owmoJxKB19lMfSYgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1950&nbsp;</strong><em>(Latin America dẫn đầu với 42% d&acirc;n số sống ở đ&ocirc; thị, c&ograve;n Whole World chỉ chiếm 30%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRqtdjaUboCzZ9xO94floozUgWe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của Latin America đến 2030&nbsp;</strong><em>(tăng mạnh l&ecirc;n 70% v&agrave;o năm 2000, dự kiến đạt 80% v&agrave;o năm 2030)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SwTMdgvHaoTB5Ux9wuAltoUYg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3)&nbsp;<strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của Whole World đến 2030</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><em>(tương tự, tăng l&ecirc;n 48% v&agrave;o năm 2000 v&agrave; được dự đo&aacute;n sẽ tiếp tục tăng đến 60% v&agrave;o cuối giai đoạn)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BQRsdAy1tor0z6xpumhlnvFNgeg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Africa v&agrave; Asia</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fvhed7nhSoM7J9xQ4K2lNdClgth\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1950&nbsp;</strong><em>(Africa v&agrave; Asia c&oacute; mức d&acirc;n th&agrave;nh thị gần như giống nhau, với 12% cho Africa v&agrave; 14% cho Asia)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0tndI50koRSBPxoNTblbN7igCh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của cả hai đến năm 2000 </strong><em>(cả hai khu vực đều tăng đ&aacute;ng kể trong v&ograve;ng 50 năm tiếp theo, đều đạt 39%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L7K2djZ6roIiLXxBX27lEgK8gbe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của cả hai đến năm 2030 </strong>(d&acirc;n số đ&ocirc; thị của Asia dự kiến đạt 55%, cao hơn một ch&uacute;t so với Africa ở mức 52%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YcKgd2ZQhoZ6q3xBXhJl7Hbvg2e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ULeBdpxNfowzy4xT48xldjB9gjb\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số đ&ocirc; thị\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PEYfdxwruonWE6xkitJlrRsWgif\" data-list=\"bullet\">proportion of urban population</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IIRxdZGqHopBxaxpIwpl67tkgpf\" data-list=\"bullet\">percentage of city dwellers</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nn2Udq05AoSDbQxU5omlCJnOgAf\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UHlhd4sxeogKoFxRtKslTBMGgFg\" data-list=\"bullet\">The bar chart illustrates the <strong>proportion of urban population</strong> in four regions of the world.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bjr4dxe9VoVCQbxyhvblI4Q5g5f\" data-list=\"bullet\">Latin America consistently had the highest <strong>percentage of city dwellers.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2667,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IElLdmf8goqyw0xMZhMlxb9BgAd\">The bar chart illustrates the proportion of urban population in four regions of the world, namely Africa, Asia, Latin America and the entire world, in 1950, 2000, and 2030, with the last year being a projection.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 24948,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2668,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NyxSd2IjsooYxDxqM9jlCyPkgne\">Overall, all four regions experienced or are expected to experience an upward trend in urbanization over the 80-year period. Throughout this time, Latin America consistently had the highest percentage of city dwellers, while Africa and Asia recorded considerably lower figures.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 24948,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2669,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HnDRdYvqXoQ9Q4x0jjalQMRqgVf\">Regarding regions with higher urbanization rates, in 1950, Latin America led with 42% of its population residing in urban areas, compared to 30% for the global average. By 2000, the former had risen substantially to 70%, and this figure is projected to reach 80% by 2030. Similar changes can be seen in the figure for the worldwide urban population, which increased to 48% in 2000 and is expected to continue climbing to 60% at the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 24948,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2670,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>As for Africa and Asia, both regions started with nearly identical urbanization levels in 1950, at 12% and 14%, in that order. Over the following five decades, these figures saw similar increases, with both significantly rising to 39% in 2000. By 2030, Asia's urban population is predicted to reach 56%, slightly higher than Africa's projected figure of 51%.</p>",
            "question_id": 24948,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
        "writing_graph_image": "4469ea5e-ae81-4a0d-8ec8-12ac1b08aea7",
        "writing_graph_description": "1/ Chart Description:\n\nChart type: Bar chart (multiple years)\nTitle: The chart below gives information about the growth of the urban population in certain parts of the world, including the prediction of the future.\nTime period: 1950, 2000, 2030 (projection)\nUnits: Percentage (%)\nAxes:\n\nX-axis: Regions (Whole World, Africa, Asia, Latin America)\nY-axis: Percentage (0% - 90%)\n\n\nCategories/Groups: 4 regions compared across 3 time periods\n\n\n2/ Data in CSV format:\ncsv\nRegion,1950,2000,2030\nWhole World,30%,48%,60%\nAfrica,12%,39%,51%\nAsia,14%,39%,56%\nLatin America,42%,70%,80%",
